2026-10-21T07:36:00.8781292Z -- Building presets (item 17)
2026-10-21T07:36:00.8781646Z   ok   a masonry house has more thermal mass than a timber one
2026-10-21T07:36:00.8782152Z   ok   an older house loses more heat
