2026-10-21T07:36:00.8787847Z   ok   with radiators the heavy floor coasts as part of the room store
2026-10-21T07:36:00.8788446Z   ok   nonsense options are clamped rather than propagated
2026-10-21T07:36:00.8788911Z   ok   a valid non-radiator emitter is kept, only an unknown one is clamped
