2026-10-21T07:36:01.0198397Z   ok   an EntryConfig survives deepcopy and a pickle round trip: equal, still an EntryConfig, its parsed fields kept, its stored values still read-only
2026-10-21T07:36:01.0198736Z   ok   the configured fuse is 20 A x 3 phases = 13.8 kW, no fuse is None, and 16 A on one phase is 3.68 kW
